# While Handy is recording, Numen recognizes only these controls. Hissing or
# shushing is unambiguous because it cannot accidentally become dictated text.
<hiss-begin>: run numen-control finish
<shush-begin>: run numen-control finish
finish: run numen-control finish
finish dictation: run numen-control finish
cancel dictation: run numen-control cancel
